In article <55264@cup.portal.com> John_David_Galt@cup.portal.com writes:
>In nethack 3.0i, I can read a scroll while blind.  Why?

It, IMO, is not a bug.  When you read a scroll blind, it doesn't say,
"As you read the scroll, it disappears" which would imply physically looking
at the scroll, and reading it, but rather uses "As you read the incantations
(or something like that) on the scroll, it disappears."  Thus, you can only
read scrolls that you have already read before, so that you would know which
magic words to read...

